type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Proves IE-22's unchanged eventual uniform sharp-constant Target, including failure of every smaller real constant. The package also proves the exact reviewed squared upper estimate uniformly over every positive row count and actual near-sharp unit-row matrix witnesses beyond every dimension and aspect-ratio threshold.\n\nThe 19 proof modules use actual Gaussian measures, covariance/spectral projection, a finite threshold net and finite product sampling. All three reviewed theorem names are selected by Comparator with no replaceable definitions, global LeanCert kernel mode and only the three standard axioms. Permanent IDs, canonical paths, the original README, original mathematical target and attribution are preserved. The historical scaffold, including its unsupported extra convergence clause, remains byte-exact in the frozen input packet and text archive.\n\nValidation: both independent pre-proof approvals; one independent complete-source approval (166 checks); fresh local compilation of all 27 canonical Lean sources plus exact endpoint, frozen/live Target and historical-support consumers. The second independent full replay/package review and real Linux/Comparator checks are pending. IE-22 remains Solved while those gates run.\n\nStacked on #367; this draft contains the IE-22 change above the audited TR-06 branch. No merge or Lean-verified promotion is requested yet.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T01:39:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T01:39:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"88b9366e6cfcef7e60a2d740ff8a7101399bf1a8","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ajt60gaibb:codex/ie22-full-target-oct23","ref":"codex/ie22-full-target-oct23","repo":{"id":1360959635,"node_id":"R_kgDOUR6Ykw","name":"OpenProblemsInNLA","full_name":"ajt60gaibb/OpenProblemsInNLA","owner":{"login":"ajt60gaibb","id":1814063,"node_id